Adding an Architecture
-----------------------

Create arch/<name>/ with:
- hal_impl.c    (HAL functions, UART)
- pagetable.c   (page table manipulation)
- entry.S       (boot entry, VBAR/IDT)
- context.S     (context save/restore, context_switch)
- interrupts.S  (exception handlers)
- timer.c       (timer init -> scheduler_tick)
- gic.c / amp.c (SMP boot)
- linker.ld     (memory layout)

Build with: make ARCH=<name>

